			</div>
			<p class="text-sm text-slate-700 mt-4 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl">The DRE worksheet appears to book 4 outdoor tables and 15 benches as {compact(reserves.dreTablesAndBenches)}/yr—{percent(derivedFinancials.dreCorrectionShare, 0)} of the contribution—probably replacement costs entered as annual amounts. If {reserves.studyVendorEngaged} confirms it, the straight-line need is ≈{compact(reserves.dreCorrectedNeed)}/yr. Elevators and building systems look underfunded, so any cut should wait for the study and be indexed +3%/yr afterward.</p>
