				<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mt-3">Every month was rebuilt from the general ledger and ties to the reported totals. September’s balance sheet and reserve schedule were checked visually; income statement lines were cross-checked against the monthly summary and the ledger rebuild. Balance sheet, equity bridge ({currency(reported.operatingEquity, 2)}), operating cash, and reserve fund reconcile at September 30. Owner-level records were used only in aggregate.</p>
				<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mt-2"><strong>Scope:</strong> analytical review, not an audit, reserve study, or legal opinion. Estimates are labeled. Board approval of the statements was not verified. Private source documents are excluded from this site.</p>
